 "aboutHostShape": "At load the plugin fits our entries to each host as the load order left it: one pick in a host that picks one entry, and none in a use-all host that only rolls other lists, since those lists carry ours. A loot overhaul that gates its stores through such lists (Damn Apocalypse's weapon store rolls its gated basic and rare lists) keeps our rounds behind its gate. providerLists are other mods' ammo lists injected into the same hosts and fitted the same way.",
