 "aboutLootScale": "Each trajectory class names the game's own ammo list of that class. At load, our lists and every list of a round we added take counts scaled by the live mean count of that list over its mean in the base game, so a loot overhaul that shrinks the vanilla lists shrinks ours alike. Without one the scale is 1.",
